  "historyUrl": "https://hayday.fandom.com/wiki/Tackle_Box?action=history",
  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\"><p><br>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Tackle_Box.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143616\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Tackle box\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Tackle box\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><figcaption>Tackle box</figcaption></figure>\n<p>The <b>tackle box</b> is the building where <a href=\"/wiki/lure-5882\" title=\"Lure\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">lures</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/net-maker-8475\" title=\"Net Maker\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">nets and traps</a> can be stored. It unlocks at <a href=\"/wiki/experience-19023\" title=\"Experience\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">experience</a> level 27. The tackle box is already standing when the <a href=\"/wiki/fishing-lake-23340\" title=\"Fishing Lake\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Fishing Lake</a> is unlocked and doesn't have to be repaired.\n</p>\n<div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Appearance</b></span></h3>\n<p>The appearance of the tackle box changes as the player upgrades it. Its final appearance is displayed when the box can store at least 70 items.\n</p>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Appearance\n</th>\n<th>Tackle Box Level\n</th>\n<th>Capacity\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1st stage</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2nd stage</td>\n<td>2 - 4</td>\n<td>25 - 35\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3rd stage</td>\n<td>5 - 10</td>\n<td>40 - 65\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Final stage</td>\n<td>11+</td>\n<td>70+\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATackle_Box_Stage_1.png\" title=\"Tackle Box Stage 1.png (26 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/6/68/Tackle_Box_Stage_1.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143557\" title=\"Tackle Box Stage 1.png (26 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"150\" width=\"118\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tackle Box Stage 1.png (26 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"150\" width=\"118\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATackle_Box_Stage_2.png\" title=\"Tackle Box Stage 2.png (27 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/8/86/Tackle_Box_Stage_2.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143604\" title=\"Tackle Box Stage 2.png (27 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"120\" width=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tackle Box Stage 2.png (27 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"120\" width=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATackle_Box_Stage_3.png\" title=\"Tackle Box Stage 3.png (29 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/0d/Tackle_Box_Stage_3.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143610\" title=\"Tackle Box Stage 3.png (29 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"120\" width=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tackle Box Stage 3.png (29 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"120\" width=\"120\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3ATackle_Box.png\" title=\"Tackle Box.png (31 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Tackle_Box.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028143616\" title=\"Tackle Box.png (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"121\" width=\"121\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tackle Box.png (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"121\" width=\"121\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading</b></span></h3>\n<p>The tackle box can initially hold 20 items. Upgrading it increases its capacity by five spaces, to a maximum capacity of 1000.\n</p><p>The box can be upgraded using the following materials. Each upgrade requires the same number of nails, screws and wood panels but the number of items requires increases by 1 with each upgrade (see the table below).\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3ANail.png\" title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Nail.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/185?cb=20191028130907\" title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Nail\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Nail.png (35 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Nail\" height=\"185\" width=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/nail-6712\" title=\"Nail\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nail</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/media/File%3AScrew.png\" title=\"Screw.png (14 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/59/Screw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130937\" title=\"Screw.png (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Screw\" height=\"99\" width=\"99\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Screw.png (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Screw\" height=\"99\" width=\"99\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/screw-6711\" title=\"Screw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Screw</a></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/unavailable-source?media=File%3AWood_Panel.png\" title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Wood_Panel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131042\" title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Wood panel\" height=\"144\" width=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Wood Panel.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Wood panel\" height=\"144\" width=\"144\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\"><a href=\"/wiki/wood-panel-2872\" title=\"Wood Panel\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Wood panel</a></div></div></div>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Upgrading table</b></span></h3>\n<table>\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Capacity from-to\n</th>\n<th><span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/4/40/Nail.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130907\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Nail\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>+<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/59/Screw.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028130937\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Screw\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>+<span><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/0/02/Wood_Panel.png/revision/latest?cb=20191028131042\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Wood Panel\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>20 - 25</b></td>\n<td>x1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>25 - 30</b></td>\n<td>x2\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>30 - 35</b></td>\n<td>x3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>35 - 40</b></td>\n<td>x4\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>40 - 45</b></td>\n<td>x5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>45- 50</b></td>\n<td>x6\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>etc.</b></td>\n<td><b>etc.</b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\"><b>Strategy tips</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>You need the same items to upgrade the silo and the tackle box.</li>\n<li>Upgrading the tackle box is not a priority at first but can help when you are doing fishing tasks in <a href=\"/wiki/derby-18422\" title=\"Derby\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">derbies</a> and need lots of lures.</li></ul>\n<hr>\n<div class=\"navmenutitle\">See also</div><div class=\"navmenubox\">\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-center wikia-gallery-spacing-small wikia-gallery-border-none wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/barn-2652\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/f/f8/Barn.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926033811\" title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Barn (331 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/silo-2654\" title=\"Silo (228 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/5/5f/Silo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250926033422\" title=\"Silo (228 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Silo (228 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\"><div class=\"thumb\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper\"><a class=\"image link-internal\" href=\"/wiki/tackle-box-9464\" title=\"Tackle Box (31 KB)\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/hayday/images/2/2c/Tackle_Box.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20191028143616\" title=\"Tackle Box (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"><img title=\"Tackle Box (31 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"\" height=\"50\" width=\"50\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div></div></div></div></div>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260831200053\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time